SUMMARY:New Moon Circus at Cornerstone Sonoma
DESCRIPTION:**New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’** at Cornerstone Sonoma from November 27 through December 27\, 2026\, with performances beginning at 3:30 p.m. This all-human circus production features breathtaking aerialists\, jugglers\, acrobats\, and clever comedy in a whimsical story about the Winter Moon’s journey back to the stars.    Set beneath an intimate European-style big top tent\, the family-friendly show blends storybook charm with celestial magic. The 90-minute performance includes a 15-minute intermission. Guests are welcome to arrive up to 30 minutes before showtime\, with light concessions and beverages available for purchase.    Tickets start at $40\, with VIP front-row options beginning at $65. Limited free parking is available at Cornerstone Sonoma.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/new-moon-circus-at-cornerstone-sonoma/
LOCATION:23570 Arnold Drive (Hwy 121), Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
GEO:-122.4693688;38.2315738
