SUMMARY:Turkey Waddle Hike at Jack London State Historic Park
DESCRIPTION:The Turkey Waddle Hike 2026 offers a refreshing way to enjoy the outdoors at Jack London State Historic Park. This guided\, moderate hike winds through beautiful mixed evergreen forests to the park’s majestic Ancient Redwood\, an old-growth coast redwood that stood long before Jack London arrived.    The scenic 3.5-mile round-trip adventure provides an opportunity to explore the park’s natural beauty\, enjoy fresh air\, and connect with nature. Participants should bring water and wear comfortable hiking shoes. Please note that non-service dogs are not permitted on backcountry trails to protect wildlife.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/turkey-waddle-hike-at-jack-london-state-historic-park/
LOCATION:2400 London Ranch Road, Glen Ellen, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.5409002;38.3566642
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Holiday,Outdoors,Sonoma County
