SUMMARY:Winter Lights Tree Lighting Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Winter Lights Tree Lighting Celebration returns to Downtown Santa Rosa for a beloved holiday tradition presented by the Santa Rosa Metro Chamber. Held at Courthouse Square\, this free community event kicks off the holiday season with live entertainment\, festive food and drinks\, family-friendly activities\, photos with Santa and the official lighting of the city’s holiday tree. With more than 40 years of bringing the community together\, Winter Lights offers a magical way for families and friends to celebrate the start of the season. Additional details about this year’s celebration will be announced soon.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/winter-lights-tree-lighting-celebration/
LOCATION:Santa Rosa, CA, United States
GEO:-122.7140548;38.440429
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Food,Holiday,Outdoors,Sonoma County
