DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Metro Chamber’s Winter Lights Tree Lighting Celebration brings holiday magic to Downtown Santa Rosa at Courthouse Square. This free community event features festive family activities\, live entertainment\, seasonal food and drinks\, photos with Santa\, and the lighting of the city’s holiday tree. A beloved local tradition for more than 40 years\, Winter Lights offers a festive way for families and friends to kick off the holiday season together.
