SUMMARY:Holiday Celebration at Dry Creek Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Dry Creek Vineyard welcomes guests to its annual Holiday Celebration + Marketplace\, a beloved tradition featuring limited-release wines\, seasonal bites\, and festive holiday carols. Guests can sample wines perfect for gifting and holiday gatherings while browsing unique gifts from local vendors and artisans.    Celebrating Small Business Saturday\, this festive event offers an opportunity to support local businesses and creatives while enjoying the spirit of the season.
