SUMMARY:Holiday Open House at Sojourn Cellars
DESCRIPTION:Sojourn Cellars hosts a Holiday Open House and Pop Up Market\, offering an afternoon of local shopping and wine tasting. The tasting space transforms into a vibrant marketplace featuring local artisan producers and artists. Guests can sip signature Sojourn wines while browsing unique\, handcrafted gifts and supporting local creators. This festive gathering offers a chance to discover one-of-a-kind items while enjoying the wines of Sojourn Cellars.
