SUMMARY:Thotty's Naughty Revue at The Main Street Theater
DESCRIPTION:Thotty’s Naughty Revue brings an evening of burlesque\, pole dance and variety entertainment to Main Street Theater in Sebastopol. The intimate show features local and traveling performers showcasing pole artistry\, sensual dance\, glamour and the art of the tease. In collaboration with Wax Poetic\, the evening continues with curated vinyl\, vintage-inspired music\, mingling and dancing for a lively night of entertainment.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/thottys-naughty-revue-at-the-main-street-theater/
LOCATION:104 N Main St , Sebastopol, CA, 95472, United States
