SUMMARY:A Celtic Christmas at Luther Burbank Center
DESCRIPTION:Direct from New York’s Off-Broadway and London’s West End\, Pace Live presents A Celtic Christmas by A Taste of Ireland at the Luther Burbank Center for the Arts. This holiday spectacular brings the spirit of Christmas to life through melodic folk mash-ups\, acapella tap battles\, and heartwarming storytelling.    Featuring former World Irish Dance Champions and stars from Lord of the Dance and Riverdance\, this powerhouse performance blends electrifying rhythms with world-class talent. Audiences will enjoy an evening packed with traditional tunes\, heartfelt ballads\, Irish wit\, and classic holiday carols. It is an unforgettable celebration brimming with energy\, charm\, and festive magic for the entire family.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/a-celtic-christmas-at-luther-burbank-center/
LOCATION:50 Mark West Springs Rd, Santa Rosa, CA, 95403, United States
GEO:-122.7492174;38.4931765
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Dancing,Drink,Family Friendly,Holiday,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County,Wine
